Original commit body from 409174e:

Add two new convention YAML files that enrich symbols from specialized
analyzers with concepts:

- language-conventions.yaml: CUDA kernels/functions, WGSL shaders,
  COBOL programs/sections, LaTeX document structure, Starlark rules/macros
- config-conventions.yaml: NPM dependencies/scripts, Maven dependencies/modules,
  Android permissions/components, Cargo dependencies/workspaces/targets,
  Poetry dependencies, TypeScript project references

These patterns enable symbols from json_config.py, xml_config.py, toml_config.py,
cuda.py, wgsl.py, cobol.py, latex.py, and starlark.py to participate in
concept-based features like filtering and future entrypoint detection.
